Pinhole — third-party licenses
==============================

Pinhole itself is released under the Pinhole Licence 1.0 (see LICENSE).

Pinhole ships NO model weights and NO inference-engine binaries. The engines
below are downloaded once, on first run, from their official GitHub releases
(pinned + SHA-256 verified, see config/engine.yaml). Their license texts are
reproduced here as required by SPEC §10; the downloaded archives also carry
their own copies. Model licenses are shown on each model card in the app and
are the user's responsibility (e.g. FLUX.1-dev is non-commercial).

